<body>
    <h1>Clear implementation cache library</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <p><strong>FOR MAC or LINUX Users:</strong></p>
<h2 id=3D"Clearimplementationcachelibrary-Tocleanacacheforspecificproject/j=
ar"><strong>To clean a cache for specific project/jar</strong></h2>
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p>Find all the cache files related to that project</p></li>
</ol>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">find ~/=
.gradle/caches -name your-project-artifact-id</pre>
</div>
</div>
<p>The above command will return all the cache files related to&nbsp;<code>=
your-project-artifact-id</code>&nbsp;(e.g.,&nbsp;<code>com.google</code>).<=
/p>
<ol start=3D"2">
<li>
<p>ass the path of each result to the command below:</p></li>
</ol>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">rm -rf =
&lt;each file returned&gt;</pre>
</div>
</div>
<ol start=3D"3">
<li>
<p>Finally, to pull latest artifacts, run this:</p></li>
</ol>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">gradle =
clean install</pre>
</div>
</div>
<p></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>One liner to clear the cache</p></li>
</ul>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">for fil=
e in `find ~/.gradle/caches -name yourprojectartifactid`; do `rm -rf $file`=
; done</pre>
</div>
</div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
